{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing refund method is a stub, while payment transactions, order totals, status history, and inventory already have reusable services. I’m adding a persisted return aggregate plus a single service that validates atomically, computes prorated tax, updates stock/status/history/totals, and creates the REFUND transaction; the API will expose the requested JSON shape and status codes."}}
